<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>aftermaths - Ερχόμαστεεεε (ξανά)!</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>aftermaths.gr</h1>
            <h2>Μαθηματικά και... κάτι ακόμα.</h2>
        </header>

        <main>
            <p class="announcement">
                Λύνουμε δύο-τρία άλυτα προβλήματα και σύντομα ξανά κοντά σας!
            </p>

            <div id="countdown" class="countdown">
                <div><span id="days">00</span><br>Ημέρες</div>
                <div><span id="hours">00</span><br>Ώρες</div>
                <div><span id="minutes">00</span><br>Λεπτά</div>
                <div><span id="seconds">00</span><br>Δευτερόλεπτα</div>
            </div>

            <!-- <section class="subscribe">
                <h3>Don't miss the launch!</h3>
                <p>Enter your email to get notified when we go live and receive our first exclusive math puzzle.</p>
                <form action="#" method="POST"> <input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" required>
                    <button type="submit">Notify Me</button>
                </form>
			</section> -->
        </main>

        <footer>
            <p>&copy; 2025 aftermaths.gr. Μας ακολουθείτε;</p>
            <div class="social-links">
                <a href="https://substack.com/@aftermathsgr">Subtack</a> | 
                <a href="https://www.instagram.com/aftermathsgr">Instagram</a> | 
				<a href="https://www.facebook.com/aftermaths.gr">Facebook</a>
            </div>
        </footer>
    </div>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
